    "count.remindersOn" : {
      "comment" : "How many reminders are switched on, as in \"3 reminders on\". Plural variations: one, other. The space before \"on\" is a no-break space (U+00A0): the phrase is shown in a narrow row value, and it must wrap as \"3\" / \"reminders on\", never leave \"on\" alone. Keep a no-break space between the last two words in translations.",
